// =============================================================================
//  UProjectTab.pas  —  Project IDE tab for MiniDelphi
//
//  Features
//  ────────
//  • New / Open / Save / Save As for .mdp source files
//  • Project files (.mdproj) group multiple .mdp files together
//  • When a project is open, ALL .mdp files in the project folder are
//    discovered and shown in the tree (folder-scan approach)
//  • Main file is shown in bold; right-click to change it
//  • F5 / Run always executes the project main file, regardless of which
//    file is currently being edited (Delphi-style)
//  • New file (with project open) is created inside the project folder
//  • Examples tree remains accessible below the Project node
//  • Run / Stop buttons (Stop interrupts a running program)
//  • Insert button + right-click menu for code snippets
//
//  File formats
//  ────────────
//  .mdp      Plain text MiniDelphi source  (UTF-8)
//  .mdproj   Simple text project file:
//              [Project]
//              Name=MyProject
//              Description=...
//              MainFile=Main.mdp
// =============================================================================

